Package: waydesk-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: José Mendonça <jmendonca@gmail.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: sway, foot, libopenh264-8 (>= 2.6), libpam0g, libpam-runtime, libxkbcommon0, openssl, systemd, adduser
Recommends: pipewire, pipewire-pulse, pulseaudio-utils, wireplumber, wl-clipboard
Description: RDP server giving each account its own sway desktop
 Accounts log in over RDP with their normal password and get a private,
 headless sway session that survives disconnects. A small root helper checks
 passwords (PAM) and starts the sessions; the network-facing daemon runs as
 an unprivileged account.
 .
 Early software, one author. Plain TLS login: use a VPN or an SSH tunnel.
